{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56262","headline":"失题 · 田淳","name":"失题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲行闲坐复闲吟，一片澄然太古心。\n拾得好诗清似玉，练来虚府静如琴。\n已将蛇足师陈轸，懒把蝇头爱华歆。\n必也长磨到如此，退身何更羡云岑。\n（见《新编分门古今类事》卷十二引李畋《该闻录》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"田淳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}